  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">224184_Start Fund ALERT 935 Mongolia (Anticipation of wildfire)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project designed for Mongolia Anticipation of Steppe Fire 2025. The project encompasses four groups of activities: 1) allocation of firefighting resources (essential equipment and safety gear) for herder communities and soum governments; 2) capacity building for firefighting volunteers in the soums; 3) community education and awareness initiatives; and 4) development for steppe fires&apos; triggers. These preventive measures were selected based on a rapid and joint assessment conducted with soum governors responsible for disaster preparedness and herders in the target eastern provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
